# Smart Cheque Blockchain Core - Project Document

## Project Overview

The Blockchain Core is the foundational layer of the Smart Cheque platform, providing secure, transparent, and auditable on-chain execution of payment instruments. This project encompasses the development of a complete blockchain infrastructure including smart contracts, node operations, cross-chain bridges, and supporting services.

